K_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20729,"speakerName":"「御肉丸」","textMapHash":334324058,"text":"ハハッ、気にするな、パイモン…こうしてお前たちと話せることができたんだから、俺はもう満足だ。","nextNodeIds":[790270114]},{"nodeId":790270114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20729,"speakerName":"「御肉丸」","textMapHash":861536434,"text":"いやぁ、思えば…船でありながら、お前たちと気持ちよく話せていたなんて、もはや幻の夢みたいなもんさ。","nextNodeIds":[790270115]},{"nodeId":790270115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20729,"speakerName":"「御肉丸」","textMapHash":4170931386,"text":"だが、最後に頼みたいことがあるんだ…","nextNodeIds":[790270116]},{"nodeId":790270116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":441660546,"text":"構わないから言って…","nextNodeIds":[790270117]},{"nodeId":790270117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20729,"speakerName":"「御肉丸」","textMapHash":3349578986,"text":"この前、体が見つかったら、この海域でお前たちを乗せてやると約束したが、体はとうにバラバラだった…","nextNodeIds":[790270125]},{"nodeId":790270125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20729,"speakerName":"「御肉丸」","textMapHash":2490969130,"text":"宝もほとんど持っていかれて、価値のあるものは残っていなかった…","nextNodeIds":[790270118]},{"nodeId":790270118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20729,"speakerName":"「御肉丸」","textMapHash":1805656490,"text":"だが今回は、大海賊船の名に誓って、必ず立派な宝物を見つけると約束しよう！騙されたと思って、俺に着いてきてくれないか！","nextNodeIds":[790270119]},{"nodeId":790270119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3793559522,"text":"「御肉丸」はもうすぐ話せなくなるかもしれないからな…","nextNodeIds":[790270120]},{"nodeId":790270120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2975218554,"text":"それに…お宝があるらしいぞ！行ってみようぜ！","nextNodeIds":[790270121,790270122]},{"nodeId":790270121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2235297394,"text":"しょうがないな。","nextNodeIds":[790270123]},{"nodeId":790270123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1265256978,"text":"じゃ、さっそく出発しよう！","nextNodeIds":[790270124]},{"nodeId":790270124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20729,"sp